#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Racers: unflagged cold boot -> Main Menu -> BUILD -> NEW RACER ->
# Build Driver (MIX) -> Make License ("ADA") -> Quick Build -> 3D Brick Builder ->
# DirectInput mouse click Exit Door -> FINISH -> save Save\0\LEGORac1 -> clean exit (#373).
#
# Sequence:
# - Flips 0..247: plays unskippable lmicmp.avi, skips hvscmp.avi (Space) and
#   introcmp.avi (mouse click).
# - Flips 560..751: enters BUILD -> NEW RACER -> MIX driver -> MAKE LICENSE.
# - Flips 840..1055: clears "PLAYER", types "ADA", confirms, enters BUILD CAR.
# - Flips 1150..1397: QUICK BUILD assembles custom kart, enters 3D Brick Builder,
#   uses DirectInput relative mouse to click the Exit Door at (68, 435), and
#   selects FINISH to persist the custom driver & car into Save\0\LEGORac1.
# - Flip 1500: closes cleanly (CloseHandle flushes Save\0\LEGORac1 to Tree::profile).
flip 240 key Space down
flip 241 key Space up
flip 245 move 320 240
flip 246 down left
flip 247 up left
flip 560 key Return down
flip 561 key Return up
flip 640 key Return down
flip 641 key Return up
flip 720 key Return down
flip 721 key Return up
flip 740 key Down down
flip 741 key Down up
flip 750 key Return down
flip 751 key Return up
flip 840 key Return down
flip 841 key Return up
flip 856 key BackSpace down
flip 857 key BackSpace up
